ebKit 引擎存在的跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，影响使用该引擎的 Apple Safari 浏览器和 iOS 系统。攻击者可通过构造恶意网站并利用 drag-and-drop 操作在用户浏览器中注入任意 JavaScript 或 HTML 代码，实现跨站脚本攻击。漏洞影响 Safari 版本低于 5.1.4 的用户，以及 iOS 版本低于 5.1 的设备。攻击者仅需诱导受害者访问精心 crafted 的网站并执行拖放操作即可触发漏洞，导致受害者浏览器执行恶意脚本，可能窃取会话 cookie、执行任意操作或获取敏感信息。基于 CVSS 4.3 评分（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:N），该漏洞被评估为中危等级。Apple 已在后续版本中修复了此安全问题，建议用户升级到支持版本以获取保护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0590"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:53Z","remediation":"升级 Safari 至 5.1.4 或更高版本，或将 iOS 升级至 5.1 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：在 Safari 偏好设置中禁用 JavaScript，或避免在不可信网站上进行拖拽操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/79975","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0590.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0590","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/038ebe8769d42a55c13282848dec427251956ad1/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0590.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0590.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/30757a66c9ec8372e159aadb0aa3af74af2b2bdf/2012/CVE-2012-0590.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0590.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-05xx/CVE-2012-0590.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0590.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0590.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0590.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0072","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0589","title":"Apple Safari 跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞","description":"Apple WebKit 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，影响 iOS 5.1 之前版本及 Safari 5.1.4 之前版本。远程攻击者可通过未明确的攻击向量注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，导致在用户浏览器上下文中执行恶意脚本。该漏洞源于 WebKit 对用户输入过滤不充分，攻击者可构造恶意页面诱导受害者访问，窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户会话或进行钓鱼攻击。CVSS 评分 4.3（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:N），属中危级别。Apple 已在 iOS 5.1 及 Safari 5.1.4 中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0589"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apple iOS 至 5.1 或更高版本，并将 Safari 升级至 5.1.4 或更高版本。若暂时无法升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，或避免访问不可信网站以降低 XSS 攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/79968","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0589.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0589","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0589.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0589.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/10077249260e5fe97e33a99425b1ad7686bc1139/2012/CVE-2012-0589.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0589.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-05xx/CVE-2012-0589.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0589.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0589.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0589.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0071","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0587","title":"Apple Safari 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"该漏洞是针对WebKit引擎的跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，影响使用该引擎的Apple Safari和iOS等浏览器。攻击者可通过向目标发送包含恶意Web脚本或HTML的请求，利用未修复的WebKit解析漏洞实现代码注入。该漏洞影响Safari 5.1.4及更早版本，以及iOS 5.1之前的版本，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，在浏览器渲染网页过程中执行恶意脚本，可窃取用户会话、劫持用户会话或执行其他恶意操作。此类攻击通常通过精心 crafted的网页实现，用户访问受控网站时自动触发，攻击过程透明且难以察觉。该漏洞被归类为CWE-79类型安全漏洞，CVSS评分4.3，表明其安全影响中等，具有网络攻击面，攻击复杂度适中。该漏洞已在Microsoft和Apple的安全更新中得到修复，建议用户立即更新到最新版本以获取保护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0587"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apple iOS 至 5.1 或更高版本，或将 Safari 浏览器升级至 5.1.4 及以上版本。如暂时无法升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，并避免访问不可信网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/79966","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/b