，iOS 设备升级到 5.1 及以上版本，Apple 已于 2012 年发布相关安全更新修复该内存破坏与跨站脚本问题。若暂时无法升级，应避免访问不可信或未知的恶意网站，并可在网络层通过 Web 代理、内容过滤或防火墙规则过滤可疑脚本与第三方 Cookie，同时限制浏览器开启执行脚本和跨源功能的权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/79965","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0586.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0586","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0586.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0586.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7753953b586683c230526e07a6b8b2948b832025/2012/CVE-2012-0586.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0586.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-05xx/CVE-2012-0586.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0586.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0586.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0586.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0069","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0585","title":"Apple iOS Safari 隐私浏览功能权限绕过漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5.1 之前的 Safari 私人浏览（Private Browsing）功能存在隐私保护绕过漏洞（CWE-264）。由于 Safari 未能有效隔离正常浏览会话与私人浏览模式下的访问记录，远程攻击者可诱导用户访问一个特制的恶意网页，该页面中的 JavaScript 代码通过调用 History API 的 pushState 或 replaceState 方法写入历史条目，从而在用户开启私人浏览时仍将相关网址记录进浏览器历史，突破预期的隐私设置。此漏洞影响 iOS 5.1 及更早版本的 Apple iPhone、iPad、iPod touch 设备，攻击条件为诱使用户在默认或正常网络环境访问恶意构造网页，攻击无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），可导致用户隐私信息（如浏览记录）泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0585"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:52Z","remediation":"tags.\n\nLet me write a clean, specific, actionable Chinese remediation, ≥20 chars.<value>建议立即将受影响设备升级至 iOS 5.1 及以上版本，或安装苹果 2012 年 3 月通过 iTunes 更新（APPLE-SA-2012-03-07-2）及 iOS 5.1 安全更新的补丁（http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html），该版本修复了 Safari 私人浏览模式中 pushState/replaceState 绕过隐私设置的问题；更新前请通过 iTunes 或 iCloud 备份重要数据。对暂时无法升级的设备，可在\"设置-访问限制（内容与隐私）\"中停用 Safari 浏览器，或限制浏览器历史记录的保留；同时提示用户切勿在私人浏览（Private Browsing）会话中访问不受信任的网页或点击可疑链接，避免恶意 JavaScript 调用 History API 写入非预期浏览记录，减少隐私泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/79964","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73871","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0585.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0585","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0585.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0585.json","htt